{
  "description": "PARKED (not loaded: the corpus loaders read modules/<area>/*.json only). DirtyFilter cases where the fast-math x86 reference's own noise exceeds module_defaults against the no-fast-math reference (the port is bit-identical to the latter): resonant 12 and 24 dB sweeps to the top of the cutoff range and resonance 0.95 at 4x. See LEDGER 'M5a PR 7'. To re-enable after the owner's decision, move this file to modules/filters/, write its hashes, and apply the decided comparison; tests/dirty_filter.rs picks it up by filter model.",
